id=tb371fc_finddevice_off
name=TB371FC finddevice off
version=0.2-reviewed-20261101
versionCode=2
author=TB371FC maintainers
description=Keeps com.xiaomi.finddevice stopped (MIUI forbids disabling this core package). It requests the missing mtdservice@1.0 HAL every ~2s because the cardapp TA is absent on this port (查找手机 is a known-broken feature on this ROM). Remove the module to let it run again.
